    "observed_dialogue": [
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.B.dialog-act.s9553330.25",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "So , the immediate next step is to start determining the functional design , or",
        "participant": "FIE038",
        "role": "UI"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.122",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Yes .",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.124",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "To come up with the functional design and uh to discuss with Ed , okay , and how it's going to be work ,",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.125",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "and uh first of all with your user acceptance , okay , how it looks like and how it's going to be work in the market , okay ,",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.B.dialog-act.s9553330.10",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "So I think I'll have to interact with Christine and discuss with her , so that she's not designing something that my studies will show right off the bat that it's not going to work ,",
        "participant": "FIE038",
        "role": "UI"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.112",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Yes .",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.51",
        "participant": "MIE085",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "No ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.B.dialog-act.s9553330.26",
        "participant": "FIE038",
        "role": "UI",
        "text": "<disfmarker> okay ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.123",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Okay ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.B.dialog-act.s9553330.27",
        "participant": "FIE038",
        "role": "UI",
        "text": "Mm-hmm ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.105",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Yeah ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.106",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Th Christine , yeah <vocalsound> ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.B.dialog-act.s9553330.16",
        "participant": "FIE038",
        "role": "UI",
        "text": "because depending on what users want , depends on how you sell it , what tag lines you attach to it , how you try to make it more attractive to users ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.113",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Yeah ."
      }
    ],
    "peer_items": [
